name pst-ode
category Package
revision 63295
shortdesc Solving initial value problems for sets of Ordinary Differential Equations
longdesc The package defines \pstODEsolve for solving initial value
longdesc problems for sets of Ordinary Differential Equations (ODE)
longdesc using the Runge-Kutta-Fehlberg (RKF45) method with automatic
longdesc step size adjustment. The result is stored as a PostScript
longdesc object and may be plotted later using macros from other
longdesc PSTricks packages, such as \listplot (pst-plot) and
longdesc \listplotThreeD (pst-3dplot), or may be further processed by
longdesc user-defined PostScript procedures. Optionally, the computed
longdesc state vectors can be written as a table to a text file.
